OL,3,GNEWSAFresh hope in Shakespeare
OL,4,AInstitute relocation row
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe director of the Shakespeare
OL,7,FInstitute has said he is delighted that
OL,8,Fpositive talks have been held in the
OL,9,Fdays since controversial plans to
OL,10,Frelocate the centre from
OL,11,FStratford-upon-Avon to Birmingham were
OL,12,Fput on hold.
OL,14,FA joint statement, issued by the
OL,15,Finstitute, including director Michael
OL,16,FDobson, and the University of
OL,17,FBirmingham, said all parties were now
OL,18,Fworking together "to secure a vibrant
OL,19,Fand viable future for the Institute in
OL,20,FStratford-upon-Avon".
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
