OL,3,GNEWSAFresh hope in Shakespeare
OL,4,AInstitute relocation row
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe talks follow the university's
OL,7,Fdecision to suspend the proposed move
OL,8,Fafter a backlash from academics,
OL,9,Fstudents and actors, who argued the
OL,10,Finstitute should remain in
OL,11,FShakespeare's hometown.
OL,13,FDobson described the discussions as
OL,14,F"very good news".
